Subject: [PATCH 0906/3799] soh: rename D_80B88B10 -> sUnusedColors

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence GUESS) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: Color_RGBA8[2] with no reader anywhere in the tree; nothing indicates what the two colours were for.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Magic_Dark/z_magic_dark.c.

Tagged [LLM:GUESS] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Magic_Dark/z_magic_dark.c | 3 ++-
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Magic_Dark/z_magic_dark.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Magic_Dark/z_magic_dark.c
index 733dbfe6d..a09afaae9 100644
--- a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Magic_Dark/z_magic_dark.c
+++ b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Magic_Dark/z_magic_dark.c
@@ -34,7 +34,8 @@ const ActorInit Magic_Dark_InitVars = {
 #include "overlays/ovl_Magic_Dark/ovl_Magic_Dark.h"
 
 // unused
-static Color_RGBA8 D_80B88B10[] = { { 50, 100, 150, 200 }, { 255, 200, 150, 100 } };
+// LLM generated name (GUESS), was D_80B88B10: Color_RGBA8[2] with no reader anywhere in the tree; nothing indicates what the two colours were for.
+static Color_RGBA8 sUnusedColors[] = { { 50, 100, 150, 200 }, { 255, 200, 150, 100 } };  // was D_80B88B10 [LLM:GUESS]
 
 void MagicDark_Init(Actor* thisx, PlayState* play) {
     MagicDark* this = (MagicDark*)thisx;
